WEBVTT

10:22.240 --> 10:23.560
He is such a bore.

31:01.640 --> 31:03.680
These are all to be typed tonight,

31:03.760 --> 31:08.960
signed by you
and sent first post tomorrow.

31:10.120 --> 31:15.080
This is to Duke Michail Michailovich

31:15.160 --> 31:17.640
asking after his health

31:17.720 --> 31:22.040
and suggesting
an alternative date for lunch.

31:22.120 --> 31:24.840
This one is to Lady Lewington.

31:24.920 --> 31:26.640
It is quite flirtatious

31:27.480 --> 31:29.160
but I hear she is a whore

31:29.240 --> 31:32.800
and will respond.

31:33.360 --> 31:35.800
And this is to Mr. Shelby.

31:36.360 --> 31:39.840
He has the effrontery
to check our sapphires,

31:39.920 --> 31:45.360
we need proof
he has the material we require,

31:45.440 --> 31:48.400
at a time of our choosing.

31:51.240 --> 31:52.880
How much did you drink?

31:53.560 --> 31:55.920
Wine, no vodka.

31:59.560 --> 32:04.160
At the end of this business

32:04.240 --> 32:09.120
you may have to kill Mr. Shelby yourself.

32:10.080 --> 32:11.040
Can you do it?

32:15.120 --> 32:16.560
Of course.

38:59.120 --> 39:01.440
He will catch the train
from Naples to Paris

39:01.520 --> 39:03.280
and then the boat train to London.

39:09.160 --> 39:12.360
And he can be here by Sunday, yes?

43:58.440 --> 43:59.640
Kill!
